# 32-bit ARM (armv7) kernel configuration for IPQ50xx.
#
# Derived from ipq40xx (the other arm32 Qualcomm target, same 6.18 kernel):
# every symbol it sets is kept unless the generic or the qualcommax target
# config already provides a real value, and the IPQ50xx driver set is added
# explicitly because a subtarget cannot inherit another subtarget config.
#
# Without AUTO_ZRELADDR (which the generic config leaves disabled) and
# ARM_PATCH_PHYS_VIRT kconfig makes PHYS_OFFSET visible and syncconfig fails.

# CONFIG_APQ_GCC_8084 is not set
# CONFIG_APQ_MMCC_8084 is not set
